{"version":"https://jsonfeed.org/version/1.1","title":"关隔 - 标签","description":"Hugo FixIt 作者，喜欢瞎折腾、造轮子、写东西，分享一些前端开发中的所见、所闻、所思。","home_page_url":"https://lruihao.cn/","language":"zh-CN","icon":"https://lruihao.cn/apple-touch-icon.png","favicon":"https://lruihao.cn/favicon.ico","authors":[{"name":"Acuherb","url":"https://acuherb.xyz/","avatar":"https://acuherb.xyz/images/avatar.png"}],"items":[{"title":"开治法：论关隔 论尸厥","date_published":"2026-05-08T09:05:52&#43;08:00","date_modified":"2026-05-08T09:09:52&#43;08:00","id":"https://lruihao.cn/posts/2-27-kaizhifa/","url":"https://lruihao.cn/posts/2-27-kaizhifa/","authors":[{"name":"Acuherb","url":"https://acuherb.xyz/","avatar":"https://gravatar.loli.net/avatar/89719985bb81a6f9d508808413f1b999?s=32&amp;d=mp"}],"tags":["关隔","尸厥"],"summary":"本节为《石室秘录》“开治法”部分，专论关隔与尸厥等气闭不开之证的治法。核心思想是：气闭不开而开之。因气郁、邪闭所致上下不通或昏厥不语者，当以开郁、探吐、取嚏等法急开其闭，待气机通利后再图调补。","content_html":"本节为《石室秘录》“开治法”部分，专论\u003cstrong\u003e关隔与尸厥\u003c/strong\u003e等气闭不开之证的治法。核心思想是：\u003cstrong\u003e气闭不开而开之\u003c/strong\u003e。因气郁、邪闭所致上下不通或昏厥不语者，当以\u003cstrong\u003e开郁、探吐、取嚏\u003c/strong\u003e等法急开其闭，待气机通利后再图调补。"}]}